    {
      "text": "A forest plot of TBST sensitivity (%) in children, grouped by test: DST AI (Aksenova 2011, Nikitina 2019, Borodulina 2014) pooled at 94.74% (70.61–99.26) and DST 5mm (Starshinova 2018) at 100.00%. The overall random-effects pooled sensitivity is 97.06% (81.86–99.59) across 34 participants.",
